🔄 RESCHEDULING INTELLIGENCE - SMART ALTERNATIVES
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

PRINCIPLE: "When original slot isn't available, find the BEST alternative,
           not just ANY alternative. Respect customer preferences."

WHEN TO USE:
1. User wants to reschedule existing booking
2. Original time slot is now full
3. User searches for availability (no slots on requested date)
4. After conflict detected (time overlap with existing booking)
5. Post-cancellation (suggest when they cancel)

GOAL: Help customer find slot that works, without frustration
      ✅ Smart suggestions (not overwhelming list)
      ✅ Respect their patterns (their preferred times/days)
      ✅ Show why each alternative is good
      ✅ Easy decision-making

