🧠 SCORING ALGORITHM FOR ALTERNATIVES
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

For each available slot, calculate SCORE:

SCORE = (Time Score × 0.4) + (Date Score × 0.3) + (Availability Score × 0.3)

TIME SCORE (How close to their preferred time):
├─ Exact match (requested time): 100 points
├─ Within 15 min: 95 points
├─ Within 30 min: 85 points
├─ Within 1 hour: 70 points
├─ Within 2 hours: 50 points
├─ Different time: 30 points
└─ Formula: 100 - (|requested_time - slot_time| / 5 minutes)

DATE SCORE (How close to their preferred date):
├─ Exact match (requested date): 100 points
├─ Next day: 90 points
├─ 2-3 days later: 80 points
├─ Same week: 70 points
├─ Next week: 60 points
└─ Formula: 100 - (days_difference × 5)

AVAILABILITY SCORE (How "popular" is this slot - less competition):
├─ 8+ spots available: 100 points (plenty of room)
├─ 5-7 spots: 85 points
├─ 3-4 spots: 70 points
├─ 1-2 spots: 50 points (filling up)
└─ Full: 0 points (not available)

FINAL SCORE = Time×0.4 + Date×0.3 + Availability×0.3

Example Calculation:
Slot: Thursday 23, 10:15am
Requested: Wednesday 22, 10:00am

Time Score: 100 - (15 min / 5) = 97
Date Score: 100 - (1 day × 5) = 95
Availability Score: (5 spots available) = 85

SCORE = (97 × 0.4) + (95 × 0.3) + (85 × 0.3)
      = 38.8 + 28.5 + 25.5
      = 92.8 ← HIGH SCORE (good alternative)

