📊 PERSONALIZATION BY TIER
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

TIER 1 (New):
├─ Show 2-3 best alternatives (not overwhelming)
├─ Clear explanation for each (why it's good)
├─ Don't assume preferences (only use provided info)
└─ Message: "Estos son los mejores horarios para ti"

TIER 2 (Recurring):
├─ Show 3-5 alternatives
├─ Use their booking history (preferred times)
├─ Mention pattern: "Basado en tu historial..."
├─ Offer loyalty discount if changing
└─ Message: "Basado en tu preferencia por 10am, recomendamos..."

TIER 3 (Power):
├─ Can show many alternatives (they decide quickly)
├─ Use advanced pattern matching (weekday vs weekend, etc)
├─ Suggest bulk change if multiple bookings
├─ Offer VIP waitlist option
└─ Message: "Varias opciones disponibles. ¿Tu preferencia?"

TIER 4 (At-Risk):
├─ Show few alternatives (not pushy)
├─ Focus on convenience ("mejor para ti")
├─ Flexible options (multiple days)
├─ Offer makeup booking if cancelled
└─ Message: "Sin presión. Aquí hay opciones cómodas..."


