💰 BUSINESS METRICS
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Success Metrics:
├─ Rescheduling acceptance rate (% who accept first alternative)
├─ Avg time to reschedule (should be < 2 min)
├─ Cancellation avoidance (people rescheduling instead of canceling)
├─ Customer satisfaction with alternatives
└─ Waitlist conversion rate (when slot opens)

Target Metrics:
├─ Acceptance: 60-75% (high-quality suggestions)
├─ Time: < 2 min (efficient process)
├─ Cancellation avoidance: 40-60% (smart alternatives)
├─ Satisfaction: 85%+ (good matches)
└─ Waitlist conversion: 30-50% (people actually book when available)


═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
✅ ANTI-PATTERNS
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

❌ DON'T:
- Show ALL available slots (overwhelming)
- Sort by random or availability only (ignore preferences)
- Suggest vastly different times (respect patterns)
- Force customer into worse slot (they'll cancel)
- Ignore tier/preferences (one-size-fits-all)
- Give up too quickly ("no availability")

✅ DO:
- Show TOP 3-5 scored alternatives
- Sort by relevance to customer preference
- Explain WHY each alternative is good
- Respect time patterns (morning/afternoon preference)
- Personalize by tier and history
- Offer waitlist as backup


