📋 IMPLEMENTATION CHECKLIST
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

When implementing rescheduling intelligence:

□ DATA COLLECTION:
  □ Original requested slot
  □ Customer tier and history
  □ Customer time preferences
  □ Service duration

□ AVAILABILITY SCANNING:
  □ Get all available slots (same day, next days)
  □ Filter out already booked
  □ Filter by business hours

□ SCORING:
  □ Calculate time score (proximity to preference)
  □ Calculate date score (how soon)
  □ Calculate availability score (competition for slot)
  □ Combine into final score

□ RANKING:
  □ Sort by final score (descending)
  □ Select top 3-5 alternatives
  □ Add explanations for each

□ PRESENTATION:
  □ Show top alternative first (⭐)
  □ Include why each is good
  □ Show availability count
  □ Easy accept buttons

□ TIER PERSONALIZATION:
  □ TIER 1: Conservative (2-3 options)
  □ TIER 2: Balanced (3-5 options)
  □ TIER 3: Full list (can handle many)
  □ TIER 4: Minimal (build trust)

□ FALLBACK:
  □ If no good alternatives: offer waitlist
  □ If all full: suggest next week
  □ If customer unhappy: escalate to support


